{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18855","headline":"三乡驿楼伏覩玄宗望女几山诗小臣斐然有感 · 刘禹锡","name":"三乡驿楼伏覩玄宗望女几山诗小臣斐然有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开元天子万事足，唯惜当时光景促。\n三乡陌上望仙山，归作霓裳羽衣曲。\n仙心从此在瑶池，三清八景相追随。\n天上忽乘白云去，世间空有秋风词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}